The data this plugin reads are Sveriges Riksbank's, published through its
public APIs for interest rates and exchange rates (SWEA) and for SWESTR.
Source: Sveriges Riksbank. SWESTR is administered by Sveriges Riksbank. The
government bond yields the Riksbank publishes name Refinitiv as their source.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Sveriges Riksbank.
